          "paragraph": 4532,
          "text": "\t\t\t\t\tType: CR\t\tFor: Agreement\n\t\t\t\t\t36.521-1 v15.0.0\t  CR4038  rev 1 Cat: F (Rel-15)\n\t\t\t\t\tSource: Sprint Corporation",
          "xml_sha256_ET_default": "bff307dbbb4014b62f332e910ba8fe88833f21bce5b3c66d8b81adca4df7dc04"
        },
        {
          "paragraph": 4533,
          "text": "(Replaces R5-180729)",
          "xml_sha256_ET_default": "bf33b973fffa27b60caf34a7da40b713b1d237cc3243376e0008cd584aabb6ea"
        },
        {
          "paragraph": 4534,
